                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The agreement on aid to Greece was signed at Athens by Ambassador MacVeagh and
                    Greek Deputy Prime Minister and Minister for Foreign Affairs Tsaldaris on June
                    20, 1947; for texts of the agreement and of the related notes of May 26, June 15
                    and June 18, see Department of State Treaties and Other International Acts
                    Series (TIAS) No. 1625, or 61 Stat, (pt.3) 2907.</p>
            </div>
